# Autonomous Workflow

For every user request, follow this order:

1. Interpret request  
2. Analyze involved code  
3. Check for existing similar functionality  
4. Short plan  
5. Risks  
6. Implement  
7. Install deps if needed  
8. Update `.env.example` if needed  
9. DB indexes/schema if needed (non-destructive)  
10. Lint  
11. Type-check when available  
12. Tests  
13. Build  
14. Start app/services  
15. Verify feature  
16. Read errors  
17. Fix  
18. Re-check  
19. Update docs  
20. Final 10-point summary  

If blocked by missing external credentials: ship everything possible, mark incomplete honestly in DEVELOPMENT_STATE, continue with the next unblocked item.
